    "description": "Play Car Games for the ultimate car driving simulator experience. Feel the rush of driving fast super cars!\n\nCar Games Online is an open world multiplayer driving games.\nParking cars, lean road signs and perform extreme driving with Car Games.\n\nCar Games has the one thing that none of the top racing games offer: freedom.\n\nExplore cities, discover shortcuts, and blaze trails. Or just stop at a traffic light - you know, for the fun of it.\n\nFEATURES\n- Over 50 Truck, Pickup, Bus, and Classic Cars to choose from.\n- Free roam, drive anywhere and explore an open world ONLINE\n- Racing and driving simulator with real players.\n- Extreme driving games with multiplayer world.\n- Complete missions to earn huge rewards!\n- Buy cars, upgrade them, collect them all!\n- Push your car to it's limit by challenging the city boss to a race!\n- Supports PS and Xbox controllers!\n\n\n\nThis app contains Auto-Renewable Subscriptions that provides access to unlimited online, unlimited gas, exclusive cars, ad-free experience and more:\n\u2022 Race Pass Membership/VIP club offered\n\u2022 1 week, 1 month or annual subscription available.\n\u2022 Your subscription will be charged to your iTunes account at confirmation of purchase and will automatically renew (at the stated duration) unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period\n\u2022 Account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period\n\u2022 Subscriptions may be managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the Account Settings in iTunes after purchase\n\u2022 Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when the user purchases a subscription to that publication, where applicable\n\u2022 Privacy policy: http://www.cargamesinc.com/privacy-policy\n\u2022 Terms of use: http://www.cargamesinc.com/terms-of-use",
